          "pitch": -0.22238275714299505,
          "title": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Library | </font><font face=\"宋体\">图书馆</font></span></p>",
          "text": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\">A gateway to knowledge and lifelong reading.</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">通往知识与阅读的殿堂。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Our library offers a wide range of levelled English books, research tools, and independent reading opportunities to foster literacy and inquiry skills.</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">丰富的分级英文藏书及信息检索资源，培养学生阅读习惯、研究能力与自主学习能力。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>"
